Licensing of the duckdb/ workload
=================================

Material derived from DuckDB: the injection patches (bugs/*/injection.patch, patches/), the
mechanical reproducers (bugs/*/repro.sql whose meta.json "reproducer" is "mechanical"; they are
statements copied from DuckDB's sqllogictest files) and their recorded outputs, and the DuckDB test
names, queries, expected results, code excerpts and commit/pull-request titles quoted in oracle.json,
meta.json and RATIONALE.md. It is derived from DuckDB's source, test suite and history
(https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb, tag v2.0.0) and is licensed under the MIT License, below.
Copyright 2018-2026 Stichting DuckDB Foundation.
No code from DuckDB's third_party/ directory is included; the injections touch only src/.

Everything else in this directory (the bin/ scripts, tool/, README.md, METHOD.md, REPORT.md,
marauder.toml, bugs.csv, the reproducers written for this workload (bugs/*/repro.sql whose
meta.json "reproducer" is "agent") and their recorded outputs, and the labels and verification
records in meta.json, oracle.json and RATIONALE.md) is Copyright Datadog, Inc. and licensed under
the Apache License 2.0 (../LICENSE).

The following is the DuckDB license at v2.0.0
(https://github.com/duckdb/duckdb/blob/v2.0.0/LICENSE), verbatim:

